cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use panpath-audit, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
title: panpath-audit
abstract: >-
  A self-contained command-line tool that verifies whether the genome and
  haplotype paths embedded in a pangenome graph (GFA) reconstruct exactly the
  source FASTA sequences they represent, with localized diagnostics and
  CI-grade exit codes.
version: 0.1.1
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/gkanogiannis/panpath-audit"
url: "https://github.com/gkanogiannis/panpath-audit"
authors:
